# This repo root doubles as the live CNC12 controller install directory on
# the control PC (job files, logs, backups, position/tool state, third-party
# exes/dlls, etc.). Only a curated set of PLC source/config/doc files should
# ever be tracked, so ignore everything by default and explicitly un-ignore
# what belongs in git. This also covers compiler scratch output (mpu.plc,
# plc.out, mpu.dbg, mpu.sym, xplc.sym, mpu-stats.txt) without listing each one.
/*

!/.claude/
!/docs/
!/.gitattributes
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
!/LICENSE.md
!/README.md
!/Centroid-Acroloc-ALLIN1DC.src
!/compile.sh
!/mfunc*.mac
!/mpucomp.exe
!/plc.map
!/plcmsg.txt
!/language.msg
